-- =============================================================================
-- MODULE 400 — Party, Product, and Classification Bridge
-- All cross-table FKs use composite (tenant_id, id) for cross-tenant safety.
-- shared.* code-based FKs (currency, uom) stay as-is — they are global singletons.
-- =============================================================================

